#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:53 C/gnumeric.xml:37
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be moved and resized on the worksheet, as "
"explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-moveNresize\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan flytta och ändra storlek på varje komponent i kalkylbladet, enligt "
"beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-moveNresize\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:58 C/gnumeric.xml:42
msgid ""
"The stacking order, from the front to the back, which determines which "
"widgets obscure each other, can be changed using the entries in the context "
"menu, as explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"restacking\"/>. However, as explained in the note above, the widgets do not "
"currently stack under the other graphical elements."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra komponenternas lagerordning, från främst till längst bak, med "
"alternativen i snabbmenyn. Lagerordningen avgör vilka komponenter som "
"skymmer varandra. Se <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-restacking\"/>."
" Som nämnts ovan placeras komponenterna dock för närvarande inte bakom andra"
" grafiska element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:67 C/gnumeric.xml:51
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be deleted using the context menu and its "
"<guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item, as explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-deleting\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ta bort varje komponent via snabbmenyns menyalternativ "
"<guimenuitem>Ta bort</guimenuitem>, enligt beskrivningen i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-deleting\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:82
msgid "Labels."
msgstr "Etiketter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:84
msgid ""
"Labels are intended to be small text elements which can be added to the "
"worksheet. Since it is currently not possible to edit the text field, these "
"widgets are not currently usable. The properties of the border and "
"background of the widget can be changed but, because the word \"Label\" is "
"always present, the rectangle drawing element, presented in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphics-drawings-rectangle\"/> will be more useful."
msgstr ""
"Etiketter är små textelement som kan läggas till i kalkylbladet. Eftersom "
"texten för närvarande inte går att redigera är de här komponenterna inte "
"användbara. Du kan ändra komponentens kantlinje och bakgrund, men eftersom "
"texten ”Etikett” alltid visas är det mer användbart att använda "
"rektangelverktyget som beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphics-drawings-"
"rectangle\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:96
msgid "A label widget."
msgstr "En etikettkomponent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:100
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a label "
"widget. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/widget-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"etikettkomponent.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:115
msgid "Configuring the properties of the label"
msgstr "Konfigurera etikettens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:117
msgid ""
"The properties of the label can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the label and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra etikettens egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över etiketten och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:125
msgid ""
"The label outline color and width, as well as the background, \"fill\", "
"color can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra färg och bredd på etikettens kontur samt bakgrundens "
"fyllningsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:131
msgid "The configuration dialog for label properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för etikettens egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:135
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the dialog"
" used to configure checkbox widget elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-label.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för att konfigurera etikettkomponenter.</phrase> </textobject>"
